stdout:
stderr:
Usage of smoke:
  -concurrency int
    	concurrent synthetic request workers (default 1)
  -duration duration
    	sustained soak duration instead of a fixed request count
  -json
    	print JSON output
  -loki string
    	Loki base URL (default "http://localhost:3100")
  -prometheus string
    	Prometheus base URL (default "http://localhost:9090")
  -rate float
    	rate limit in requests per second; 0 means unlimited. Unset defaults to 50 with --duration, unlimited otherwise (default -1)
  -requests int
    	number of app requests to send (ignored with --duration) (default 3)
  -service string
    	target service.name for correlated trace verification
  -tempo string
    	Tempo base URL (default "http://localhost:3200")
  -url string
    	application URL to request
